<title>USA: J.P. Morgan Q3 shr shrinks with charge.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan Q3 shr shrinks with charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.32		    $1.78</p>
<p> Net		 276,000		  360,000</p>
<p> Revs		1,549,000		1,549,000</p>
<p> Trading Revs    510,000		  399,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $5.60		    $4.62</p>
<p> Net		 1,155,000		930,000</p>
<p> Revs		5,050,000		4,386,000</p>
<p> Trading Revs    1,965,000		1,007,000</p>
<p>		     (All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q3 earnings include special after-tax charge of $42 million, or $0.21 per share.</p>
<p>1996 nine month earnings include first quarter after-tax charge of $33 million, or $0.17 per share, related primarily to severance.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
